<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK OFFERS FOUR, SIX-MONTH CDS.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK OFFERS FOUR, SIX-MONTH CDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Kredyt Bank SA said in a statement it was introducing new certificates of deposit, available for companies and individuals. </p>
<p>It said the certificates, which will have maturity of four and six months, and have a value of 1,000, 5,000 and 10,000 zlotys.</p>
<p>The four-month certificates carry interest of 18 percent and the six-month 18.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
